From: LM-G820N Developer <dev@lmg820n.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] qcom: use factory main-camera AF geometry and SSC gravity

Separate the IMX363 calibration distance from its near search distance,
apply the factory Q baseline and gravity projection, and compute the
pose-dependent search endpoints. Acquire SSC acceleration only while the
main camera streams and track focused-lens gravity changes at the factory
fine-step threshold.

